# APP VAN — gates

1. Read `AGENTS.md`, `mainrule.mdc`, APP index/core, workflow and this gate in the canonical order.
2. Inventory only bounded backend, frontend, wire, data and test surfaces required by the outcome.
3. Record production entrypoint, owner/runners, contract boundary and failure behavior before APP PLAN.
4. Do not create an INTEG phase or write product code during VAN.

Abort: unbounded discovery, missing outcome boundary, or a plan that splits one vertical slice into separate role queues.
